# ralph-config.json Template

Copy this to `ralph-config.json` at your project root. Adjust models, limits, and phases to match your workflow.

```json
{
  "version": "1.0",
  "models": {
    "sm": "sonnet",
    "dev": "sonnet",
    "qa": "sonnet",
    "reviewer": "sonnet",
    "architect": "sonnet",
    "docs": "haiku"
  },
  "limits": {
    "maxIterations": 40,
    "devRetries": 2,
    "qaRetries": 1,
    "reviewRetries": 2,
    "agentMaxTurns": {
      "sm": 20,
      "dev": 50,
      "qa": 30,
      "reviewer": 15,
      "architect": 12,
      "docs": 10
    }
  },
  "phases": {
    "architect": true,
    "sm": true,
    "dev": true,
    "qa": true,
    "review": true,
    "commit": true,
    "docUpdate": true
  },
  "execution": {
    "dryRun": false,
    "autoCommit": true,
    "branchStrategy": "direct",
    "verbose": false,
    "pauseBeforeCommit": false,
    "pauseBetweenPhases": false
  },
  "selection": {
    "sortBy": "sprint-then-sp",
    "preferSmallWins": true,
    "maxStoryPoints": 0
  }
}
```

## Key Settings

| Setting | Values | Effect |
|---------|--------|--------|
| `models.*` | `haiku`, `sonnet`, `opus` | AI model per agent phase |
| `phases.*` | `true`/`false` | Enable/disable phases |
| `execution.branchStrategy` | `direct`, `feature` | `direct` = commit to current branch |
| `execution.dryRun` | `true`/`false` | Describe actions without executing |
| `selection.sortBy` | `sprint-then-sp`, `sp-asc`, `risk-desc` | Story selection priority |
| `selection.maxStoryPoints` | 0-13 | Filter stories by max SP (0 = no limit) |
